lockfile.js is Yarn's test file for its lockfile parser, copied unchanged as test data on 23
November 2026 from https://github.com/yarnpkg/yarn at commit
c2dda503f3759b5be5f0e24ecd9cf5c97a540147, path __tests__/lockfile.js. Its inputs and the trees
it expects are transcribed into the tests of src/yarn1.rs, each with the line it comes from.
The file is never run.

